category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libiconv-devel
sdesc: "C/C++ multi-platform library for dynamically generating Excel(TM) files (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "xlsLib is a multiplatform, a C/C++ library for dynamically generating
Excel(TM) files (*.xls format). It allows the generation of these files
directly without the need of other assistive software."
skip:

homepage: https://sourceforge.net/projects/xlslib/
license: BSD-2-Clause
